Ghost Wolf Normal
    Events
        Unit - A unit Starts the effect of an ability
    Conditions
        (Ability being cast) Equal to ENHANCEMENT_GhostWolfNormal 
    Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Triggering unit) Equal to Nazgrek
            Then - Actions
                Animation - Queue Nazgrek's Attack Slam animation
                Wait 1.00 seconds
                Set VariableSet VarPoint = (Position of Nazgrek)
                Unit - Move NazgrekMorph instantly to VarPoint, facing (Facing of Nazgrek) degrees
                Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_VarPoint)
                -------- Transfer Str / Agi / Int --------
                -------- Transfer health --------
                Unit - Set life of NazgrekMorph to (Life of Nazgrek)
                -------- Transfer mana --------
                Unit - Set mana of NazgrekMorph to (Mana of Nazgrek)
                -------- Transfer level --------
                Hero - Set NazgrekMorph Hero-level to (Hero level of Nazgrek), Hide level-up graphics
                -------- Transfer xp --------
                Hero - Set NazgrekMorph experience to (Hero experience of Nazgrek), Hide level-up graphics
                -------- Transfer Items --------
                For each (Integer MorphInteger) from 1 to 6, do (Actions)
                    Loop - Actions
                        Hero - Drop the item from slot MorphInteger of Nazgrek.
                        Hero - Give (Last dropped item) to NazgrekMorph
                -------- MORPH from Ghost Wolf --------
                Unit - Remove Nazgrek from the game
                Unit - Unhide NazgrekMorph
                Unit - Unpause NazgrekMorph
                Set VariableSet Nazgrek = NazgrekMorph
                Unit - Remove Ghost (Visible) from Nazgrek
                Unit - Turn collision for Nazgrek On.
                Player - Enable Shield Block (50) for Player 1 (Red)
                Player - Enable Shield Block (75) for Player 1 (Red)
                Player - Enable Shield Block (100) for Player 1 (Red)
                Animation - Queue Nazgrek's Spell Slam animation
                Animation - Queue Nazgrek's stand animation
                Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_VarPoint)
                -------- tmp --------
                -------- Increase Crit and Dodge --------
                -------- sound --------
                Sound - Play GhostWolfMorph <gen> at 100.00% volume, attached to (Triggering unit)
                Selection - Clear selection for Player 1 (Red).
                Selection - Select Nazgrek
            Else - Actions
